    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d201">

                <pb facs="0366" n="272" xml:id="pg272"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Sir Julian Pauncefote
                        to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-06-22"><hi rendition="#italic">June 22,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In reply to your note No. 122, of 16th
                    instant, I have the honor to inform you that I am duly authorized by Her
                    Majesty’s Government to assent, and do hereby assent, to the agreement therein
                    proposed, empowering the scientists of both nationalities now proceeding to the
                    Pribilof Islands to kill fur seals to such extent and in such manner as the
                    purposes of their investigations may require.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Julian
                    Pauncefote.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
